{"title":"Searching a B+ tree index","sub":"Every node is one page read from disk. Fewer levels, fewer reads.","kind":"graph","interval":2200,"scenarioLabel":"Query","legend":[["a","pages read on the way down"],["good","leaf pages holding the answer"],["c","leaf chain"]],"graph":{"w":630,"h":260,"r":28,"nodes":[{"id":"root","x":300,"y":40,"label":"40"},{"id":"i1","x":150,"y":125,"label":"20"},{"id":"i2","x":440,"y":125,"label":"60 80"},{"id":"l1","x":70,"y":220,"label":"5 12"},{"id":"l2","x":200,"y":220,"label":"20 31"},{"id":"l3","x":320,"y":220,"label":"40 47"},{"id":"l4","x":440,"y":220,"label":"60 66"},{"id":"l5","x":560,"y":220,"label":"80 95"}],"edges":[{"u":"root","v":"i1","dir":true},{"u":"root","v":"i2","dir":true},{"u":"i1","v":"l1","dir":true},{"u":"i1","v":"l2","dir":true},{"u":"i2","v":"l3","dir":true},{"u":"i2","v":"l4","dir":true},{"u":"i2","v":"l5","dir":true},{"u":"l1","v":"l2","dir":true},{"u":"l2","v":"l3","dir":true},{"u":"l3","v":"l4","dir":true},{"u":"l4","v":"l5","dir":true}]},"scenarios":[{"name":"key = 47","frames":[{"caption":"A B+ tree index on a column. Each circle is one disk page holding sorted keys; internal pages only route, the actual rows' keys live in the leaves, and the leaves are chained left to right.","nodes":{},"edges":{"root-i1":"muted","i1-l2":"muted","i2-l5":"muted","i2-l4":"muted","root-i2":"muted","i1-l1":"muted","i2-l3":"muted","l1-l2":"muted","l2-l3":"muted","l3-l4":"muted","l4-l5":"muted"},"stats":[["Pages read",0]]},{"caption":"Find 47. Read the root page: 47 ≥ 40, so take the right branch.","nodes":{"root":{"cls":"a"}},"edges":{"root-i1":"muted","i1-l2":"muted","i2-l5":"muted","i2-l4":"muted","root-i2":"muted","i1-l1":"muted","i2-l3":"muted","l1-l2":"muted","l2-l3":"muted","l3-l4":"muted","l4-l5":"muted"},"stats":[["Pages read",1]]},{"caption":"Read that page: 47 < 60, so take its first child.","nodes":{"root":{"cls":"a"},"i2":{"cls":"a"}},"edges":{"root-i1":"muted","i1-l2":"muted","i2-l5":"muted","i2-l4":"muted","root-i2":"a","i1-l1":"muted","i2-l3":"muted","l1-l2":"muted","l2-l3":"muted","l3-l4":"muted","l4-l5":"muted"},"stats":[["Pages read",2]]},{"caption":"Read the leaf: 47 is here. <b>3 page reads.</b> Real pages hold hundreds of keys, so with a fan-out of ~200, even 50 million rows need only about 4 levels: 4 reads instead of scanning everything.","nodes":{"root":{"cls":"a"},"i2":{"cls":"a"},"l3":{"cls":"good"}},"edges":{"root-i1":"muted","i1-l2":"muted","i2-l5":"muted","i2-l4":"muted","root-i2":"a","i1-l1":"muted","i2-l3":"a","l1-l2":"muted","l2-l3":"muted","l3-l4":"muted","l4-l5":"muted"},"stats":[["Pages read",3]]}]},{"name":"31 ≤ key ≤ 66","frames":[{"caption":"Range query: WHERE key BETWEEN 31 AND 66. First, descend to where 31 would be.","nodes":{"root":{"cls":"a"},"i1":{"cls":"a"},"l2":{"cls":"a"}},"edges":{"root-i1":"a","i1-l2":"a","i2-l5":"muted","i2-l4":"muted","root-i2":"muted","i1-l1":"muted","i2-l3":"muted","l1-l2":"muted","l2-l3":"muted","l3-l4":"muted","l4-l5":"muted"},"stats":[["Pages read",3]]},{"caption":"Then just follow the leaf chain to the next page (40 47), no need to go back up the tree.","nodes":{"root":{"cls":"a"},"i1":{"cls":"a"},"l2":{"cls":"good"},"l3":{"cls":"good"}},"edges":{"root-i1":"a","i1-l2":"a","i2-l5":"muted","i2-l4":"muted","root-i2":"muted","i1-l1":"muted","i2-l3":"muted","l1-l2":"muted","l2-l3":"c","l3-l4":"muted","l4-l5":"muted"},"stats":[["Pages read",4]]},{"caption":"Then just follow the leaf chain to the next page (60 66), no need to go back up the tree.","nodes":{"root":{"cls":"a"},"i1":{"cls":"a"},"l2":{"cls":"good"},"l3":{"cls":"good"},"l4":{"cls":"good"}},"edges":{"root-i1":"a","i1-l2":"a","i2-l5":"muted","i2-l4":"muted","root-i2":"muted","i1-l1":"muted","i2-l3":"muted","l1-l2":"muted","l2-l3":"c","l3-l4":"c","l4-l5":"muted"},"stats":[["Pages read",5]]},{"caption":"Stop at 66: result 31, 40, 47, 60, 66, in sorted order for free. That linked leaf level is what makes B+ trees great at ranges, ORDER BY and prefix searches, which hash indexes can't do.","nodes":{"root":{"cls":"a"},"i1":{"cls":"a"},"l2":{"cls":"good"},"l3":{"cls":"good"},"l4":{"cls":"good"}},"edges":{"root-i1":"a","i1-l2":"a","i2-l5":"muted","i2-l4":"muted","root-i2":"muted","i1-l1":"muted","i2-l3":"muted","l1-l2":"muted","l2-l3":"c","l3-l4":"c","l4-l5":"muted"},"stats":[["Pages read",5]]}]}]}